WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.990
01 / Clear figures. Decisive action.
Normal-speed playback. Weighted poses, short tool trails, target travel, and brief contact holds.

2
00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:33.030
02 / One complete industrial level
Light decks and quiet seams keep the figure clear. Follow seven checkpoints through the district.

3
00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:45.780
03 / Contact drives the hit
The strike pose, damage, impact mark, and target response share one authored contact time.

4
00:00:45.780 --> 00:01:05.320
04 / Read each phase
Inspect preparation, contact, and recovery with reduced accents. All 12 figures have 85 clips. Shared branch points, planted feet, clear strikes, and separate forward recovery.

5
00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:23.530
05 / A consistent character family
Six body families. Twelve role kits. Edit proportions, color, headwear, and equipment.

6
00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:43.250
06 / Equipment in play
Staff and shield attacks use distinct moves. Rifle shots use short traces and the nearest visible target.

7
00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:57.610
07 / Small, graphic impact marks
64 procedural effects. Dark stars, paper cores, tapered trails, open dust strokes, and sparks.

8
00:01:57.610 --> 00:02:20.420
08 / The full environment kit
291 props and 185 industrial parts. Three assembled scenes: District, Service Yard, and Roof Works.

9
00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:28.600
09 / Review the actual assets
Open the live demo or download the updated pack. This is a desktop recording; Android testing is still required.
